sequenceDiagram
  participant J as JUnit adapter
  participant V as Loader / Validator
  participant E as ScenarioEngine
  participant S as Step / Connector
  participant T as Target system
  J->>V: Load and validate all files
  Note over J,V: Invalid files become failing dynamic tests
  J->>E: run(valid scenario)
  E->>E: Build fixtures and fresh scope
  loop Ordered steps until first failure
    E->>E: Resolve values once, handle set directly
    loop Once, or assertion polling with wait
      E->>S: execute(resolved params, capture requested)
      S->>T: Protocol operation
      T-->>S: Observed response
      S-->>E: Outcome, optional undo and value
      E->>E: Register undo, record last outcome
    end
    E->>E: Bind successful capture, record result
  end
  E->>S: Run registered undo actions in reverse
  Note over E,S: Best effort, cleanup exceptions logged
  E-->>J: ScenarioResult
  J->>J: Write accumulated JSON, assert success
